A couple more findings:

{{internal/getLightOrdersByIds}} is called from {{src/delivery/eater/delivery_eater_order/main/loader/OrderDetailsFromHistoricOrdersDataLoader.ts}} which is used in {{delivery_eater_order/main/service/OrderService.ts}} on 2 endpoints:

* {{getOrderSummaryForRatingPopup}}
* {{getOrderHistory}}

Both endpoints also collect data from {{DeliveryOrderService}} from {{platform/user/user_order_history}} using:

* {{/internal/getDeliveryUserLastOrder}}
* {{/internal/getDeliveryUserOrderHistory}}

The call ratio is 3:1 for {{/internal/getDeliveryUserLastOrder}} => {{getLightOrdersByIds}} is called ~3 times more to get info for the popup to rate the last order than to get info about the actual order history. See [here|http://nodemonitor.boltint.net/graph/d/trv3jI8Zk/delivery-eater-order-monitor?orgId=1&refresh=1m&from=now-2d&to=now&viewPanel=186] & [here|http://nodemonitor.boltint.net/graph/d/trv3jI8Zk/delivery-eater-order-monitor?orgId=1&refresh=1m&from=now-2d&to=now&viewPanel=187].

