* Something wrong with the current implementation => {{find}} always returns 0 even if it doesn't find files, thus proxysql flush logs always runs. I added changed the cronjob as follows:

{noformat}0 1 * * * root /usr/bin/test $(/usr/bin/find /var/lib/proxysql -name "queries.log.*" -mtime +30 -delete) && /usr/bin/mysql -h127.0.0.1 -P6033 -e "PROXYSQL FLUSH LOGS"{noformat}

