For {{CoreOrderCourierStateLogTable.getStateLogs()}} → src/delivery/order/delivery_order/main/core/table/CoreOrderCourierStateLogTable.ts, there is an internal endpoint {{"/internal/order/getStateLogs"}} that calls {{OrderController.getOrderStateLogs()}}  and the response is a StateLog for Provider | Courier | Picker | Client. For Courier it contains 

{noformat}export interface OrderCourierStateLogLatLng extends LatLng {
    age_in_seconds: number | null;
}{noformat}

where {{age_in_seconds}} is computed as how long ago we have info about the courier position relative to the DB row creation. 

{noformat}private computePositionAge(logRow: OrderCourierStateLogRow): number | null {
    const canComputeAge = logRow.created && logRow.lat_lng_timestamp;    if (!canComputeAge) {
        return null;    }
    return logRow.created - logRow.lat_lng_timestamp;
}{noformat}



This endpoint {{"/internal/order/getStateLogs"}} is called from:

* {{src/delivery/eater/delivery_eater_order/main/loader/OrderProgressLoader.ts}} (/) 
* {{src/delivery/order/delivery_order/main/admin/service/AdminService.ts}} (/) 
